---
title: "Neural likelihood estimation, and handing it to Stan"
description: >
  Learn a surrogate likelihood with nle() when your data are repeated
  independent observations, sample it with MCMC, and export it as Stan code you
  can drop into a model of your own.
output: rmarkdown::html_vignette
